<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-QWTKZyjpPEjISv5WaRU9OFeRpok6YctnYmDr5pNlyT2bRjXh0JMhjY6hW+ALEwIH" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <title>Stage Fright | 3 Decades of Rock</title>
    <style>
      /* General Styling */
      body {
        background-color: #121212;
        color: #e0e0e0;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      /* Header Image Styling */
      img {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
      }

      /* Banner Section */
      .banner {
        background-color: #1e1e1e;
        padding: 60px 20px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #bb86fc;
      }

      .banner h1 {
        font-family: 'Impact', sans-serif;
        font-size: 3em;
        margin-bottom: 0.2em;
      }

      .banner p {
        font-size: 1.5em;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-top: 0.5em;
      }

      /* Main Content */
      .container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: justify;
      }

      .highlight {
        color: #bb86fc;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .cta-button {
        background-color: #bb86fc;
        color: #121212;
        padding: 15px 30px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 1.2em;
        border-radius: 5px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        display: inline-block;
        transition: background-color 0.3s;
      }

      .cta-button:hover {
        background-color: #3700b3;
      }

      /* Parallax Section */
      .parallax {
        background-image: url('https://imgur.com/X7qV5Q3.png');
        min-height: 700px;
        background-attachment: fixed;
        background-position: center;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        background-size: cover;
      }

      /* Tour Dates Table */
      #tours {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin: 30px 0;
        font-size: 1em;
      }

      #tours th,
      #tours td {
        padding: 12px;
        border: 1px solid #444;
      }

      #tours th {
        background-color: #3700b3;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      #tours tr:nth-child(even) {
        background-color: #1e1e1e;
      }

      #tours tr:hover {
        background-color: #333;
      }

      /* Footer Section */
      footer {
        background-color: #1e1e1e;
        color: #b3b3b3;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px;
      }

      footer a {
        color: #bb86fc;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      footer a:hover {
        color: #e0e0e0;
      }

      footer .social-icons img {
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
        margin: 0 10px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- Header Image -->
    <img src="https://i.postimg.cc/SKsqZK5z/Stage-Freight-Banner.png" alt="Stage Fright Banner">
    <!-- Banner Section -->
    <div class="banner">
      <h1>3 Decades of Rock</h1>
      <p>Get ready to rock with Stage Fright!</p>
    </div>
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="container">
      <p> For years, <span class="highlight">Stage Fright</span> has been setting the Los Angeles music scene ablaze with their unique blend of rock. Night after night, this dynamic four-member band leaves audiences stunned by the sheer intensity and passion of their live performances. Known for playing in iconic venues in <span class="highlight">Los Angeles, New York, Chicago, Dallas</span>, and more, <span class="highlight">Stage Fright</span> is quickly gaining a reputation as one of the must-see acts in rock music today. </p>
      <p> Their explosive live shows bring to life a collection of powerful songs like <span class="highlight">"Night Drive", "Heartbreaker", "Break the Chains",</span> and <span class="highlight">"Lost in the Lights"</span> — songs that have become instant crowd favorites with unforgettable hooks and driving riffs. Every note from the guitar, every beat from the drums, and every soaring vocal sends shockwaves through the crowd, making their concerts an unforgettable experience you can’t help but feel. </p>
      <p> If you crave that authentic, electrifying rock ‘n’ roll spirit, <span class="highlight">Stage Fright</span> delivers it with a force that keeps fans coming back for more. </p>
      <a href="https://sites.google.com/students.d211.org/stagefright/purchase-tickets?authuser=1" class="cta-button" style="margin-left: 35%;">Purchase Tickets Now!</a>
    </div>
    <!-- Parallax Section -->
    <div class="parallax"></div>
    <!-- Energy Section -->
    <div style="height:150px; background-color:#1e1e1e; color:white; font-size:30px; padding: 20px;"> Look at the energy on that stage. Don’t just watch it, <b>LIVE IT</b>. Stage Fright delivers a rock experience that’s pure adrenaline. <b>JOIN</b> the crowd, <b>FEEL</b> the magic, and make tonight unforgettable. </div>
